									&#171; <i>Last Edit: September 09, 2004, 01:00:53 am by Gtex</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Gtex<br />Officer<br />Apotheosis<br /><img src="http://www.click-smilies.de/sammlung0304/teufel/devil-smiley-036.gif" alt="" border="0" />
